{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0177BRGKoxWzgkRXQYftoc1u","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Next.js latest stable release version\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Next.js 15\",\"url\":\"https://nextjs.org/blog/next-15\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js 16.3\",\"url\":\"https://nextjs.org/blog/next-16-3\"},{\"title\":\"Wiki.js\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wiki.js\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/next\"},{\"title\":\"Vercel Next.js releases, versions & end-of-life (EOL) dates\",\"url\":\"https://www.versio.io/en/product-release-end-of-life-eol-vercel-nextjs.html\"},{\"title\":\"next - npm\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/next?activeTab=versions\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js Latest Version - Release History, LTS & EOL\",\"url\":\"https://versionlog.com/nextjs/\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js Updates by Vercel - October 2026 - Releasebot\",\"url\":\"https://releasebot.io/updates/vercel/next-js\"},{\"title\":\"Next.js Latest Version June 2026: 16.2.7 Current Stable on npm\",\"url\":\"https://abhs.in/blog/nextjs-current-version-march-2026-stable-release-whats-new\"}]\n\nThe latest stable Next.js release appears to be **16.4.2**, based on the npm registry listing, which tags it as `latest` and shows it was published about a day before the search.\n\nOther sources are a bit behind. Versio lists 16.4.1, released as part of the 16 release on 15 October 2026, and versionlog shows 16.4.0 released 06 Oct 2026. Those pages are likely stale, since npm reflects a newer patch. The 16.x line is the current major version. The 15.x line is in its final support window, with versionlog listing 15 (LTS) end-of-life as 21 Oct 2026.\n\nFor the authoritative number, run `npm show next version` or check nextjs.org.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99ae44cf-4fd8-4dc9-8326-8c53d0c15dc0",